    rdfs:label "Designation of WTF is Ansel Adams".
_:b0_r19b1 crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin "2009-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    crm:P82b_end_of_the_end "2009-12-31T23:59:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    a crm:E52_Time-Span;
    rdfs:label "2009".
_:b0_r19b2 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The work is Sun & Rain Works' conceptual designation connected to the consignment of lot 16 at Sotheby's Photographs, 2009; it is an assertion by the artist and is not recorded as a publicly witnessed performance.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r19b3 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object;
    rdfs:label "Artwork page";
    la:digitally_carried_by _:b0_r19b4.
_:b0_r19b4 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/format> "text/html";
    a <http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D1_Digital_Object>;
    rdfs:label "Metaconceptual Art — WTF is Ansel Adams";
    la:access_point <https://www.metaconceptualart.com/artworks#work-wtf-is-ansel-adams>.
_:b0_r19b5 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "WTF is Ansel Adams";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r19b6 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "work:wtf-is-ansel-adams";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r19b7 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "A Metaconceptual Art work that Sun & Rain Works designates around its consignment of the Ansel Adams photograph 'San Francisco from Twin Peaks' (lot 16) to Sotheby's Photographs, 2009 (sale N08533, New York). Titled as a play on the auction and the canonical name of Ansel Adams, it treats the act of bringing the photograph to auction — its lot, its authority, its attribution — as the material of a conceptual work, alongside the born-digital work www.wtfisart.com. The work is a designation asserted by the artist and made explicit over time; it is not recorded as a publicly witnessed performance, and the Sotheby's catalogue lists the lot as an Ansel Adams photograph without naming Sun & Rain Works.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r19b8 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Documentation reported by Sun & Rain Works includes 2008 correspondence with Sotheby's Photographs, the public catalogue lot, photographs, and related records; these evidence the artist identity and the consignment. The fuller archive remains held by the studio pending redaction and rights review. This record asserts no historical-priority or precedence claim absent separately published evidence.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r1b0 crm:P14_carried_out_by mca:sun-and-rain-works;
    crm:P15_was_influenced_by mca:sothebys-photographs-auction-2009;
    crm:P4_has_time-span _:b0_r1b1;
    crm:P67i_is_referred_to_by _:b0_r1b2;
    a crm:E12_Production;
    rdfs:label "Designation of the auction engagement as artwork".
_:b0_r1b1 crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin "2009-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    crm:P82b_end_of_the_end "2009-12-31T23:59:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    a crm:E52_Time-Span;
    rdfs:label "2009".
_:b0_r1b2 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The artistic act is the designation, by Sun & Rain Works, of its auction engagement as a work — not the auction's ordinary business, which was carried out by Sotheby's. The designation is an assertion by the artist.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r1b3 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object;
    rdfs:label "Artwork page";
    la:digitally_carried_by _:b0_r1b4.
_:b0_r1b4 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/format> "text/html";
    a <http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D1_Digital_Object>;
    rdfs:label "Metaconceptual Art — The Auction as Artwork";
    la:access_point <https://www.metaconceptualart.com/artworks#work-auction-as-artwork>.
_:b0_r1b5 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The Auction as Artwork";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r1b6 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "work:auction-as-artwork";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r1b7 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "A Metaconceptual Art work that Sun & Rain Works designates in connection with the Sotheby's Photographs auction of 2009 (sale N08533, New York), at which Sun & Rain Works consigned an Ansel Adams photograph, 'San Francisco from Twin Peaks' (lot 16). Following the logic of the readymade, Sun & Rain Works frames its engagement with that public institutional event — its mechanism of value, authority, and sale — as the material of a conceptual work. This is a designation asserted by the artist and made explicit over time; it is not a publicly witnessed live-creation event, and the Sotheby's catalogue does not name Sun & Rain Works. Two associated works accompany the gesture: the website www.wtfisart.com and WTF is Ansel Adams.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r1b8 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Documentation reported by Sun & Rain Works includes 2008 correspondence with Sotheby's Photographs, the public catalogue lot, photographs, receipts, and related records; these evidence the artist identity and the consignment. The fuller archive remains held by the studio pending redaction and rights review. This record makes no adjudicated historical-priority claim and asserts no comparison with, or precedence over, any later artist or event absent separately published evidence.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r20b0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object;
    rdfs:label "Artwork page";
    la:digitally_carried_by _:b0_r20b1.
_:b0_r20b1 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/format> "text/html";
    a <http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D1_Digital_Object>;
    rdfs:label "Metaconceptual Art - www.wtfisart.com";
    la:access_point <https://www.metaconceptualart.com/artworks/wtfisart>.
_:b0_r20b10 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The website was built by Sun & Rain Works around 2009 in connection with its Sotheby's Photographs auction engagement; it is not recorded as having been authored live in the auction room.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r20b2 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "www.wtfisart.com";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r20b3 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "work:wtfisart";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r20b4 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "https://www.wtfisart.com/";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404626;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r20b5 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "A born-digital Metaconceptual Art work: a website built and owned by Sun & Rain Works around 2009, in connection with its Sotheby's Photographs auction engagement (sale N08533). Sun & Rain Works designates it as an associated part of the conceptual work The Auction as Artwork.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r20b6 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "www.wtfisart.com is associated by Sun & Rain Works with the conceptual work The Auction as Artwork, in which Sun & Rain Works designates its 2009 Sotheby's Photographs auction engagement as art. The designation is an assertion by the artist.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r20b7 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Sun & Rain Works reports domain-registration and hosting receipts, site metadata, and related records documenting the website's existence and date. The fuller archive remains held by the studio pending redaction and rights review.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
